    },
    "This is their story. Not all of it — the best parts happened between the logged moments. The head on your lap. The excited spin at the door. The way they looked at you.\n\nThose don't need an app to remember.": {
      "comment": "Final message in the \"Moments\" section of the memory book, summarizing the most meaningful moments of a dog's life.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta es su historia. No toda — las mejores partes pasaron entre los momentos registrados. La cabeza en tu regazo. El giro emocionado en la puerta. La forma en que te miraban.\n\nEsos no necesitan una app para recordar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C'est leur histoire. Pas tout — les meilleurs moments se sont passés entre les événements enregistrés. La tête sur vos genoux. Le tournoiement excité à la porte. La façon dont il vous regardait.\n\nCeux-là n'ont pas besoin d'une app pour s'en souvenir."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Denna is their story. Not Alla av it — the Bäst parts happened between the logged moments. The head På your lap. The excited spin Kl the door. The way they looked Kl you.\n\nThose don't need an app Till remember."
          }
        }
      }
    },
